[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嵐は過ぎたみてぇだな。お前ら大丈夫か？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like the storm's passed. Everyone alright?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、大丈夫よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I'm fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣の兆候かと思いましたが、違ったみたいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was worried it might be a sign of the Apexi, but seems that wasn't the case."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、これくらいは海じゃ起こりうることだ。\nランツェ流航海術その一。嵐に慌てるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, this kind of weather's just part of life at sea. Lanze's Rule of Seamanship Number One: Never let a storm rattle ya."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……うううぅぅ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oooh... ughhh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタ、大丈夫？\n無理しないで横になったほうがいいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta, you okay? Maybe you should lie down for a bit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタさん、冷たいお水です。\n気分が落ち着きますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here, Plachta. Some cold water might help settle your stomach."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます……ライザ、フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you... Ryza, Flocke..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、おい、あれを見ろよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa, look over there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、何！？\u3000また魔物！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, what is it!? More monsters!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナイルカの群れだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a pod of Lantarna dolphins!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわあ、かわいい！\n見て、この船と並走してるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww, they're so cute! Look, they're swimming alongside the ship!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランターナイルカさん、\nフロッケたちと一緒に旅をしてるみたいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Lantarna dolphins seem to be traveling with us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あいつらは人間にも友好的でな。イルカに乗って\n海を旅した冒険者の伝説なんてのも残ってるくらいだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're known to be friendly with humans. There's even legends of adventurers riding them across the seas."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ、素敵……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? How wonderful...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちも乗れるかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think we could ride them too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、さすがに無理じゃねえか？\n乗れたとしても、海の中に潜られたらおしまいだぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, that's asking a bit much, isn't it? Besides, if they decide to dive, you'd be in trouble."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、水中でも息ができる道具\n持ってきてなかったっけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, didn't we bring those items that let you breathe underwater?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、エアドロップね。頂獣と戦うとき、\n海に落ちても大丈夫なようにって用意してあるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh yeah, the Air Drops! We brought them in case we fell into the sea during a battle with the Apexi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一応、数には余裕がありますけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We do have extras..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かった、行ってこい。\nまあ、ちょうどいい気分転換になるだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Fine, go ahead then. Might do you all some good to have a bit of fun."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yaaay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Group"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キュイーッ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyuiii!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランターナイルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna Dolphin"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すっごーい！\u3000あんた、泳ぎ速いのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Amazing! You're such a fast swimmer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ……他にも魚がいっぱい！\n綺麗……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... Look at all the fish! They're beautiful..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、イルカさん。あっちのほうまで行ける？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Mr. Dolphin, can we go over there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キュイーッ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyuiii!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランターナイルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna Dolphin"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ、言うこと聞いてくれた！\nこっちの気持ちが分かるのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, it listened! Do you think it can understand us?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、もっと速く泳げる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, can you swim even faster?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キュイイー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyuiiii!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランターナイルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna Dolphin"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あははっ！\u3000気持ちいいー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! This feels amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]